AUDIT TRAN KY VONG (guard #10) — tinh lai tran bang SO LIEU THUC DO, khong dung xap xi §2.2
================================================================================================
  sleeve TB thuc do        = 37.5% NAV  (§2.2 gia dinh 31%)
  edge sau lai vay 14%     = +9.39%/su kien  (§2.2 dung +9,75%)
  tan suat su kien thuc do = 1.36/nam  (§2.2 dung 1,4)
  tran tinh lai f=1.10: +0.48pp/nam
  tran tinh lai f=1.20: +0.96pp/nam
  tran tinh lai f=1.30: +1.44pp/nam
  tran tinh lai f=1.50: +2.40pp/nam

  => Tran §2.2 (+2,1pp) tinh cho sleeve 31%; sleeve THUC lon hon nen tran that cao hon.
     Nhung phan VUOT tran cua ban tai-dau-tu con den tu viec sleeve duoc scale theo NAV
     da phinh (lai kep chong lai kep) — day la ban DOC NHIEU NHAT co the, khong phai so
     trung tam. Bao cao phai neo vao ban cong-them (than trong) lam so chinh.
